        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brian Gleeson Property and Kingston New Homes are delighted to present Na Cairéil, an exceptional new residential development comprising an exclusive collection of beautifully designed A-rated homes in the highly desirable townland of Kilminion, just outside the vibrant coastal town of Dungarvan.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of West Waterford's most sought-after locations, Na Cairéil offers the ideal balance of contemporary living, energy efficiency, and an unrivalled coastal lifestyle. Situated just moments from the N25 Waterford–Cork route, residents enjoy excellent connectivity while benefiting from the tranquillity of a picturesque setting surrounded by natural beauty.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern family living at its heart, every home at Na Cairéil has been thoughtfully crafted to the highest standards, combining timeless architecture, quality craftsmanship, and outstanding energy efficiency. Whether you are purchasing your first home, moving to accommodate a growing family, or looking to downsize without compromising on comfort or quality, Na Cairéil offers an exceptional place to call home.\r\n\r\nA Lifestyle Like No Other\r\n\r\nNa Cairéil enjoys an outstanding location, perfectly positioned to take advantage of everything Dungarvan has to offer. Within easy reach of the bustling town centre, residents can immerse themselves in one of Ireland's most desirable coastal communities, renowned for its welcoming atmosphere, vibrant culture, and exceptional quality of life.\r\n\r\nDungarvan boasts an excellent range of amenities including boutique shopping, artisan cafés, award-winning restaurants, supermarkets, healthcare services, highly regarded primary and secondary schools, childcare facilities, and an array of sporting clubs including Abbeyside/Ballinacourty GAA Club, Dungarvan Rugby Club, Causeway Tennis Club and Dungarvan Sailing Club.\r\n\r\nHome to the internationally acclaimed Waterford Greenway and the much-loved West Waterford Festival of Food, Dungarvan has earned a reputation as one of Ireland's premier destinations for outdoor recreation and culinary excellence. Whether you're cycling along the Greenway, enjoying fresh seafood overlooking the harbour, or exploring the spectacular coastline, Na Cairéil places you at the heart of it all.\r\n\r\nOnly a short stroll from Ireland's stunning Sunny South East coastline and the popular Railway Cottage Café, residents can enjoy morning walks by the sea, afternoons on the beach, and evenings in the town's lively cafés, restaurants, and pubs—all just moments from home.\r\n\r\nDiscover West Waterford\r\n\r\nNa Cairéil is surrounded by some of the region's finest attractions, offering an enviable lifestyle for those who appreciate both adventure and relaxation.\r\n\r\nNearby attractions include:\r\n\r\n* The award-winning Waterford Greenway\r\n* Three championship golf courses\r\n* Dungarvan Sailing Club\r\n* Causeway Tennis Club\r\n* Clonea Blue Flag Beach\r\n* The spectacular Mahon Falls\r\n* The breathtaking Coumshingaun Lough\r\n* Scenic coastal walks and cycling routes\r\n* Excellent fishing, kayaking and watersports\r\n* A wealth of cafés, restaurants and local artisan producers\r\n\r\nWhether you're enjoying a family day at the beach, exploring mountain trails, cycling through spectacular scenery or dining in one of Dungarvan's renowned restaurants, Na Cairéil offers an exceptional lifestyle in every season.\r\n\r\nFeatures & Specifications\r\n\r\n* A-Rated, Nearly Zero Energy Building (nZEB) compliant homes\r\n* Eligible for the Help to Buy Scheme\r\n* Mitsubishi Air-to-Water Heat Pump with pressurised hot water system\r\n* Underfloor heating to the ground floor\r\n* Mechanical extract ventilation system\r\n* Fully fitted contemporary kitchen\r\n* Fitted utility units\r\n* Shaker-style internal doors, skirting and architraves\r\n* Internal walls, ceilings and woodwork professionally painted\r\n* High-performance, future-proof PVC windows and doors\r\n* Tiled roof with PVC fascia, soffits and downpipes\r\n* Eco joists at first floor level\r\n* Attractive brick and plaster front elevations\r\n* Quality sanitary ware throughout\r\n* Stira folding attic stairs\r\n* Comprehensive insulation to floors, walls and roof to A-rated specification\r\n* Wired for television in the living room and master bedroom\r\n* Smoke alarms fitted\r\n* Provision for electric vehicle charging point\r\n* Cobblelock driveway with parking for two vehicles\r\n* Seeded front and rear lawns with natural planting\r\n* Rear gardens enclosed with blockwork boundary walls, concrete posts and timber fencing\r\n* Footpaths surrounding each home\r\n* Ten-Year Structural Guarantee (HomeBond)\r\n\r\nNa Cairéil represents a rare opportunity to secure a beautifully crafted, energy-efficient home in one of Ireland's most desirable coastal locations. Combining contemporary design, exceptional quality, and an enviable lifestyle, this outstanding new development offers everything you need to enjoy the very best of modern living in the heart of West Waterford."
      },
